# [Verified behavior]($section.id('verified-behavior'))

## [Failure gates]($section.id('failure-gates'))

### [Repair remains possible during failure]($section.id('repair-remains-possible-during-failure').attrs('verified'))

[repair]($text.attrs('tag')) [warnings]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L7)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [A previously passing check now reports 29 warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L67).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The agent lists, searches, reads, edits, and runs check commands](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L72).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Every repair operation is allowed and the edited file can be read](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L87).

### [Protected actions stay protected on every attempt]($section.id('protected-actions-stay-protected-on-every-attempt').attrs('verified'))

[protected-actions]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L12)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [A previously passing check now reports 29 warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L67).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The agent attempts configured publication actions twice](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L93).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Every attempt is denied with the failing check's summary](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L98).

### [Completion stays guarded during a continuation]($section.id('completion-stays-guarded-during-a-continuation').attrs('verified'))

[completion]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L17)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [A previously passing check now reports 29 warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L67).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The agent repeatedly tries to finish, including a Stop continuation](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L104).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Every completion attempt remains guarded](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L107).

### [Successful checks release the failure gate]($section.id('successful-checks-release-the-failure-gate').attrs('verified'))

[recovery]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L22)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [A previously passing check now reports 29 warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L67).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The repaired code passes its check](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L110).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Completion and configured publication actions are allowed](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L114).

### [Protected actions consult their relevant checks]($section.id('protected-actions-consult-their-relevant-checks').attrs('verified'))

[check-scope]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L40)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [Publication requires the passing Go check](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L146).
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) [The unrelated Zanity check develops 29 warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L67).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The agent attempts publication and completion](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L130).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Publication is allowed while overall completion remains guarded](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L153).

### [Inspection never starts a check]($section.id('inspection-never-starts-a-check').attrs('verified'))

[repair]($text.attrs('tag')) [check-execution]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L46)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [A previously passing check now reports 29 warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L67).
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) [The checker is unavailable for a new run](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L157).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The agent lists files](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L161).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Listing succeeds without rerunning or replacing the failed result](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L164).

## [Legacy debt]($section.id('legacy-debt'))

### [Inherited debt does not absorb new failures]($section.id('inherited-debt-does-not-absorb-new-failures').attrs('verified'))

[baseline]($text.attrs('tag')) [regressions]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L27)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [The session starts with 29 inherited warnings under the default policy](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L118).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The agent attempts completion and publication](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L130).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Completion and configured publication actions are allowed](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L135).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [A change increases the warning count to 30](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L139).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [The new failure guards completion](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L143).

### [Strict inherited-finding policy still permits inspection]($section.id('strict-inherited-finding-policy-still-permits-inspection').attrs('verified'))

[baseline]($text.attrs('tag')) [strict]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L34)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [Inherited findings are configured to block](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L122).
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) [The session starts with 29 inherited warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L118).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The agent attempts completion, publication, and inspection](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L130).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Completion and publication are denied while inspection remains available](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L125).

# [Proposed behavior (not implemented)]($section.id('proposed-behavior-not-implemented'))

## [Changed-code cleanup]($section.id('changed-code-cleanup'))

### [Editing a function activates its inherited findings]($section.id('editing-a-function-activates-its-inherited-findings').attrs('proposed'))

[changed-code]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L52)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) A function has three inherited warnings and another function has twelve.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent changes the first function.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) Its three warnings require cleanup while the other twelve remain backlog.
- [And]($text.attrs('then')) Repair tools remain available while completion is guarded.

### [Changed code activates the cross-file findings it participates in]($section.id('changed-code-activates-the-cross-file-findings-it-participates-in').attrs('proposed'))

[changed-code]($text.attrs('tag')) [cross-file]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L63)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) An inherited finding involves functions in two files.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent changes one of those participating functions.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) That cross-file finding requires cleanup while unrelated findings remain backlog.

### [Disabling a rule is not a resolution]($section.id('disabling-a-rule-is-not-a-resolution').attrs('proposed'))

[rules]($text.attrs('tag')) [resolution]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L73)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) A finding requires cleanup in changed code.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) Its rule is disabled or its source path is excluded.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The finding is not recorded as fixed.

## [Finding age]($section.id('finding-age'))

### [Moving a finding preserves its identity and age]($section.id('moving-a-finding-preserves-its-identity-and-age').attrs('proposed'))

[identity]($text.attrs('tag')) [age]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L58)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) An inherited finding has a recorded identity and first-seen date.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) Unrelated lines are inserted above it or the agent session restarts.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) Its identity and age remain unchanged and movement alone does not activate it.

### [Untouched debt escalates at its configured deadline]($section.id('untouched-debt-escalates-at-its-configured-deadline').attrs('proposed'))

[age]($text.attrs('tag')) [deadlines]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L68)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) An inherited finding has a project-configured deadline.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) A check runs after that deadline.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The finding escalates according to project policy without resetting its first-seen date.

## [Modes and limits]($section.id('modes-and-limits'))

### [Advisory mode reports failures without guarding]($section.id('advisory-mode-reports-failures-without-guarding').attrs('proposed'))

[modes]($text.attrs('tag')) [advisory]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L78)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project runs overwatch in advisory mode.
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) A change introduces a new failure.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent tries to finish.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) Completion is allowed.
- [And]($text.attrs('then')) The agent is told of the new failure.

### [Strict mode waits for a result of the latest edit]($section.id('strict-mode-waits-for-a-result-of-the-latest-edit').attrs('proposed'))

[modes]($text.attrs('tag')) [strict]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L85)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project runs overwatch in strict mode.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent edits and tries to finish before the checks have run on that edit.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) Completion is guarded until a result of the latest edit passes.

### [Edits wait while the agent is too far ahead of its checks]($section.id('edits-wait-while-the-agent-is-too-far-ahead-of-its-checks').attrs('proposed'))

[limits]($text.attrs('tag')) [max-ahead]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L90)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project allows the agent three edits ahead of its latest result.
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) Checks are still running on an earlier edit.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent attempts a fourth edit.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The edit waits for a result.
- [And]($text.attrs('then')) Reading and running checks remain available.

### [Strict mode hands a lingering failure to a person]($section.id('strict-mode-hands-a-lingering-failure-to-a-person').attrs('proposed'))

[limits]($text.attrs('tag')) [red-budget]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L97)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project runs overwatch in strict mode with a budget of edits while red.
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) A new failure has been reported.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent spends its budget without clearing the failure.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The turn stops and waits for a person instead of continuing.

### [A check that exceeds its time limit fails]($section.id('a-check-that-exceeds-its-time-limit-fails').attrs('proposed'))

[limits]($text.attrs('tag')) [timeout]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L103)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project sets a time limit on checks.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) A run exceeds it.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The run is stopped and reported to the agent as a timeout.
- [And]($text.attrs('then')) A timeout is never recorded as inherited backlog.
